    "detailed_description": "This is a two-player gopher game, where one player plays the hammer and the other player plays the gopher!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGopher player: <br />\r\n--can summon a real or fake gopher by pressing the button corresponding to the cave.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHammer player: <br />\r\n--Attack by moving and clicking the left mouse button.<br />\r\n--Hitting a fake gopher will cause your opponent to lose life<br />\r\n--Hitting a real gopher will cause you to lose life.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach player has three life points, and once they are emptied, the other side wins. <br />\r\nAt the end of the time, the winner will be judged based on the number of life values",
